# direnv config for the FLEET ROOT (~/code/dvb_gn) -- the orchestration CLI, not the app.
#
# Its only job is to put this directory's `bin/` on PATH, so `orch-util` is callable by name
# from anywhere in the fleet root.
#
# This does NOT reach the clones. direnv loads the nearest .envrc only, and every clone has
# its own, so a clone would never inherit this. The clones get the same directory on PATH
# from their own untracked `.envrc.private` instead -- `orch-util add-clone` wires that up,
# and `orch-util doctor` checks it.
PATH_add bin
